      "cooked": "<p>What could be so bad that it scared Dark Visionary?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d966ed2abb460519ce32806c9a70200f55602e7b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/d966ed2abb460519ce32806c9a70200f55602e7b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d966ed2abb460519ce32806c9a70200f55602e7b_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"v1e83xBWSav4brAca0Lw3AXhfMT\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d966ed2abb460519ce32806c9a70200f55602e7b_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d966ed2abb460519ce32806c9a70200f55602e7b_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d966ed2abb460519ce32806c9a70200f55602e7b_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d966ed2abb460519ce32806c9a70200f55602e7b_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 561 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-229-writers-room-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-76\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-229-writers-room-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-76\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-229-writers-room-virtuoso-of-the-void-vol-2-76\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #229 - Writers' Room: Virtuoso of the Void Vol. 2 #76</a></h3>\n\n  <p>WHO IS THIS:   Show Notes: Run Time: 1:28:57 Not much banter as we have a lot to get into here... but definitely go watch Everything Ever All At Once. Christopher saw it when it came out and Adam just watched it in the last week and so now they...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
