      "username": "FrivYeti",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-11-01T20:07:20.278Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Psylence is amazing. What a story to come out of “we don’t quite know what to do with this”. I definitely thought that there was a specific idea in their minds that led to that voting option!</p>\n<p>And as the writer of that Papa Legba letter, I just want to say again how much I appreciate Christopher and Adam listening to concerns and actually taking the time to talk them over instead of knee-jerk reacting. The “fey masquerade” idea that Christopher had seems like a really good one, and one that also revises the story in a way that opens up new stories rather than just scrubbing something away. (I do also appreciate Adam’s perspective that Sentinels as a setting is pretty rough on all religions.)</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-11-01T20:07:20.278Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
