      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-11-01T22:45:07.263Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Um, so who or what is the prince of Æternus mentioned whose name I can’t even begin to spell to look up (sounds like it starts with G)? Not finding anything close in the Lesser Key of Solomon’s list of demons, but then again they did make the realm out of whole cloth. As I recall, there have only been two Æternus related episodes thus far - one establishing the realm, and one creating Darkstryfe and Painstake. I didn’t think there had been an opportunity for them to name drop any denizens outside of those.</p>",
