      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"29712\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The “fey masquerade” idea that Christopher had seems like a really good one, and one that also revises the story in a way that opens up new stories rather than just scrubbing something away.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>If anything, the fey have been under-utilized by Sentinels.</p>",
